# Gradle build output for the ffs-ble Android library.
#
# The root .gitignore's `/android` entry is anchored to the repo root (the generated
# app project), so it does NOT cover this module's own build dir.
#
# Worth ignoring for a second reason on this box: Gradle emits Kotlin lambda artifacts
# with very long names (e.g. `FfsBleModule$definition$lambda$34$$inlined$Function$1.dex`)
# nested deep under .transforms/, which blow past Windows MAX_PATH. `git add` fails hard
# with "Filename too long" and aborts the whole staging operation, not just that file.
build/
.cxx/
